Note: `ResolverStyle.STRICT` with pattern `yyyy` requires era-year `uuuu`. Since years here are plain positive numbers, `yyyy` works with SMART resolver but STRICT needs `uuuu`. To safely reject invalid dates like `2000-13-01` and `2026-02-30` without the year-of-era pitfall, I'll use `uuuu` with STRICT.
